        "packaging_title": "Considered",
        "packaging_copy": "<p>Every Phoria order comes with a reusable airtight <strong>storage box</strong> and satin travel pouch intended to be kept to store your Phoria piece or <strong>any other</strong> pieces in your jewellery collection.</p><p>You’ll also receive a <strong>care guide</strong> and free <strong>polishing cloth</strong> to help look after your piece.</p>",
