        "handcrafted_eyebrow": "Every Piece,",
        "handcrafted_title": "Hand crafted",
        "handcrafted_copy": "<p><strong>Quality</strong> is at the heart of Phoria. Every piece is <strong>handcrafted</strong> by skilled artisans using <strong>100% recycled 925 sterling silver</strong>, recycled 18ct gold and <strong>ethically sourced</strong>, fully traceable natural <strong>gemstones</strong>.</p><p>Our partner studio is part of the <strong>Responsible Jewellery Council</strong>, sharing our <strong>commitment</strong> to responsible sourcing, exceptional <strong>craftsmanship</strong> and jewellery designed to <strong>last</strong>.</p>",
        "fine_alt": "Phoria Fine jewellery",
