        "fine_copy": "<p>This Phoria design can be commissioned in any precious metal, any carat or any gemstone of your choice.</p><p>Every Phoria Fine piece is made to order, individually crafted to your specifications and ready within four weeks. Enquire to begin creating your piece.</p>",
